		{
			dependencies: ["7471D65394B8D846"]
			description: [
				"Before crossing a portal or entering a major structure, set a waypoint, repair equipment, carry food and blocks, and leave replacement gear at home."
				"Mark entrances rather than only destinations. A map pin in the centre of a dungeon is less useful when the exit is three floors away."
				"After returning, unload first and tell the team what changed. Shared knowledge prevents the next expedition from repeating the same mistakes."
				"Before marking this lesson complete, identify every named block, item, creature, or interface in JEI and Jade. Inspect both recipes and uses, then perform one small manual test so the objective represents understood behaviour rather than a lucky craft."
			]
			id: "19260461A2332457"
			rewards: [{
				id: "659E5F8845D69F00"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			subtitle: "Leave prepared and return with a story"
