			title: "The Expedition Protocol"
			x: 1.5d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"Open the backpack's upgrade tab and give the pack a clear role such as building blocks, food, tools, or cave loot. A tier upgrade expands the same backpack, so its identity and contents can remain consistent."
				"Pickup, magnet, refill, filter, compacting, and void upgrades each solve a different problem. Start with a whitelist and a few ordinary blocks; advanced upgrades can match items, mods, tags, NBT, damage, or existing contents."
				"Test collection, manual insertion, and unloading separately. Never enable a void rule around artifacts, relics, maps, bee cages, photographs, or anything whose data makes one copy different from another."
			]
			id: "28ED3EBB122D102D"
			rewards: [{
				id: "07A890245D4B8ADA"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			subtitle: "Configure one harmless test before trusting a rare drop"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6BD656932F8E3284"
