		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4130E2674DF6828B"]
			description: [
				"Activate a waystone before depending on it, name it with place and dimension, and make the arrival block safe from falls, mobs, lava, and obstructed exits. A pretty destination that kills a visitor is unfinished infrastructure."
				"Warp Scrolls are consumable and Warp Stones are reusable with cooldown rules; waystone-to-waystone travel may cost experience under the server's configuration. Carry a mundane backup route when crossing into an untested dimension."
				"Publish the network on a notice board or map. Do not move, rename, or wall off a public waystone without telling the group, because other players may be planning around an address they cannot inspect while offline."
			]
