		{
			dependencies: ["4B46DDE5CEC32184"]
			description: [
				"Launch the first vessel in sheltered water and learn boarding, seats, cargo, sail handling, turning, and dismounting before carrying valuables. Different hulls trade capacity and handling rather than simply replacing vanilla boats."
				"Build a lit harbour with clear water, a named berth, spare leads or boats, food, beds, and a visible route to storage. Load an expedition chest by category instead of filling every slot with unplanned loot."
				"Avoid beaching the only ship on an unknown coast. Carry a shore boat and mark the anchorage so a death, disconnect, or hurried return cannot strand the rest of the crew with no way home."
			]
