		{
			dependencies: ["1C6ED7E70D63D294"]
			description: [
				"Combine a public waystone, map or notice board, spare backpack, food, ordinary tools, blocks, beds, boats, and labelled return storage in one obvious place near the settlement exit."
				"Write a short checklist for dimension travel and a chest for recovered belongings. Keep the expensive specialist gear separate so preparation remains accessible instead of becoming a locked museum display."
				"Ask another player to use the depot without verbal instructions. Fix every hesitation they encounter; the final quest completes when the room teaches its own purpose and the route home is clearer than the route out."
